    <li>Supports Functional Programming</li>
    <li>Runs in all modern browsers</li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h1>Summary</h1>

<p>
JavaScript is one of the most popular programming languages used in web development.
It makes websites interactive, works with HTML and CSS, supports Object-Oriented and Functional Programming,
and is used for both Frontend and Backend development. JavaScript also provides excellent support for JSON,
making it suitable for building modern web applications.
</p>

